<title>USA: Motorola, Rockwell settle patent litigation.</title>
<headline>Motorola, Rockwell settle patent litigation.</headline>
<dateline>MANSFIELD, Mass. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc and Rockwell International Corp said Thursday they had settled litigation over a number of Motorola patents.</p>
<p>The patents primarily cover technologies essential to the International Telecommunications Union V.34 modem standard, Motorola said.</p>
<p>Rockwell has secured a license for the patents involved in the litigation, Motorola said.</p>
